WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.300
<i>A kingdom concealed in darkness, Deltora.</i>

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>A royal heirloom, the Belt of Deltora.</i>

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.000
<i>Long ago, in this belt fashioned by the first king,</i>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Seven gems were placed.</i>

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.600
<i>The gems possessed magical powers,</i>

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.350
<i>And were protected while the king's direct descendants wore the belt.</i>

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.150
<i>But, those gems were hidden in seven mystical lands.</i>

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Since then, the kingdom of Deltora has been shrouded in darkness.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:42.700
<i>However,</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.200
<i>The light of hope can be seen on the horizon.</i>

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.000
<i>Standing against the Shadow Lord, there is a boy who is on a quest to search for the seven gems.</i>

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.000
<i>With light and hope at their side,</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.400
<i>They are off on their adventure.</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:14.170
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.060
A brand new world is beginning
Ima hajimarunda

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:24.640
Even if there are painful things ahead
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:31.040
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:38.800
I'm starting to walk in a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:45.030
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.250
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.380
And there's no one who can stop it
Darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.400
My heart is tightening and out of control
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.760
So start flapping your wings from here
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.810
And soar high up into the sky
Ano sora he to takaku

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:09.780
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.110
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.380
That's what I believed
Sou shinjiteiru no

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:21.540
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:44.800
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:51.060
Lief and his group have finally arrived at the City of the Rats in search of the third gem.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:57.300
However, a huge group of rats suddenly attacked them and they lost all of their belongings.

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:03.830
<b>THE KING OF THE CITY OF THE RATS!</b>

00:03:04.980 --> 00:03:06.470
I'm thinking...

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:09.330
To end my journey in this place.

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:10.810
Jasmine...?

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.320
Why are you saying this all of a sudden?

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.740
It's just, I don't want to be fighting for the king any longer.

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:18.440
Eh?

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:21.810
I just can't stop thinking of what that man said...

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.140
That man?

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:26.590
The man with a big scar on his face that we met at Tom's shop.

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:32.170
<i>Thaegan's magic is not the reason why thorns run rampant.</i>

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:38.750
<i>It is the result of the King of Deltora turning a blind eye to his people for a century, leaving us scrounging in poverty.</i>

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:42.320
I also thought the same as him.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:46.200
That those thorns are something that the King of Deltora sowed.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:48.700
What are you trying to say?

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:54.190
I just don't believe that the Shadow Lord is the
only reason why the world is the way it is right now.

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:56.800
Perhaps the fault also lies with the King of Deltora.

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:59.280
That's not true, Jasmine.

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:01.440
The king knew nothing about this!

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:04.350
It's because he was deceived by his servants!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:07.210
And I'm saying that I just can't believe that.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:10.980
I mean, how could a king follow everything his retainers say?

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:14.100
To begin with, that story might also be a lie, right?

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:15.690
As if it's a lie!

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:18.980
How can you be so sure?

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.330
Were you there to see it?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.600
I-I wasn't, but...

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:28.090
Believing something you haven't seen yourself this much...

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:30.350
You're as stupid as the king, then.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:31.710
What do you mean by that?!

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:32.900
Nothing really.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:34.800
Well, either way,

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:38.060
We must walk the path we believe is right.

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:39.460
There is no other way.

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:43.080
I won't side with either of you.

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.780
Just choose what your heart says is right.

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:47.190
I suppose.

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:51.200
I originally joined you on this journey
because my mother told me to anyway,

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.750
So I'll just decide what I'll do from now on alone.

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:58.130
Well then, I guess this is where we say goodbye.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:04:58.760
Jasmine!

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:00.370
What?

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:03.370
Uhh...

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:05.130
I...

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:08.880
Um...

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:10.640
What?

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:13.530
Spit it out already.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.600
Fine, just have it your way then!

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:19.500
That was my plan anyway.

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:37.590
Why are you still following us?

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:39.680
Didn't you say you're going to leave?

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.400
Don't get me wrong.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:46.300
You guys just happen to be going the same way as me, that's all.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:47.640
Oh really?

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:50.210
That's right!

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:02.700
Jasmine!

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:06.100
We're continuing deeper into the city now.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:09.120
I'm going around that way.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.270
Is that right?

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:11.100
Yeah.

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.160
Then take care of yourself.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:16.310
You too.

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:19.260
Let's go, Barda.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:25.020
Is this really okay, Jasmine?

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:26.620
Yeah, good bye.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.790
With this, everything returns to when it was just the three of us, doesn't it...

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.320
Are you fine with this, Lief?

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:58.620
Jasmine's already said all of that herself; there's nothing I can do.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:00.440
And you're still alright with that?

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:08.760
What I must do right now is obtain the third gem from this place and nothing else.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:09.570
I see.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:13.070
I've been feeling the belt getting warm for a while now...

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.320
Just like with the topaz and ruby.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.200
What?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.550
Probably as we draw closer to that tower.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:23.660
Shall we give it a try?

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:24.440
Yeah.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.900
It sure is dark. It's perfect for a rat den..

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:37.900
The belt keeps getting warmer!

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:40.570
We're getting closer to the third gem!

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:41.990
Do you know which way?

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:42.830
That way!

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:56.810
Here they come...!

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:03.280
I can't move?!

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:06.300
They can't bite us thanks to these clothes, but...

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:07.960
We can't proceed at this rate!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.720
We can do nothing!

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:14.680
This is bad! They'll bury us alive at this rate!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.670
Lief, the Fire Beads!

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:19.060
Use them to scatter the rats!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.800
I used up all of them before!

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:23.320
We brought a lot, didn't we?!

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:25.720
You didn't bring them all with you?!

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:28.320
I didn't! I've used all the ones that I brought!

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:30.300
It's useless! They're surrounding me!

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:36.840
Fire Beads...?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:38.690
This way!

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:41.270
Jasmine!

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:44.040
Hurry and climb up here!

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:49.650
You really saved us, Jasmine!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.400
Did you come just to save us?

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:55.540
Really, you guys are useless without me around.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:58.210
But... Why do you have Fire Beads with you?

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:01.710
Let's just say that if I want something, I'll get it.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:04.170
Putting that aside...

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:06.880
This place is dangerous; there are rats everywhere.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:08.720
You're right, let's go that way.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.200
What will you do, Jasmine?

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:14.590
I personally think that it's safer with the three of us.

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:18.400
So you say, even though I was the one who saved you.

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:22.210
But, I'll go that way too.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:25.360
I'm curious to see what this blockhead is going to do next.

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:26.550
What did you say?

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:27.990
What?

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:47.780
Is this a hall?

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:49.900
What's that?

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:51.490
Seems like a central pillar.

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:55.600
I suppose even those rats weren't able to gnaw through that.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:10:01.900
Maybe the rats know instinctively that if this pillar falls, the ceiling will fall too.

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:05.880
And then sunlight would be able to shine through this building.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.800
But Filli seems to be afraid of something...

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:12.700
I wonder if there's something down there?

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.320
The belt keeps getting hotter and hotter!

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.900
As if it's going to scald me!

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.420
So the gem must be there, then?

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:23.920
I don't know...

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:26.000
I have a really bad feeling about this!

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.300
I'm really uneasy, but...

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:32.010
It feels as if the belt is telling me to go on.

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:35.150
I'm definitely getting an unpleasant feeling from this place as well.

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:39.200
<i>Lief...</i>

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:57.720
<i>Welcome, Lief of Del...</i>

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:00.200
<i>Now, come this way...</i>

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:02.570
Lief?

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:04.610
Is something wrong?

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:08.860
That voice just now... What is it...?

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:09.530
Voice?

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:11.390
Did you hear something?

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:13.700
No, I don't think I heard anything.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.810
<i>I've been waiting for you...</i>

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:19.200
<i>Now come this way... Come...</i>

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:23.330
Again... You heard it this time, right?

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.800
What are you talking about?

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:27.570
It's telling me to come this way...

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.050
Lief...!

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:31.220
What's wrong with you?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:33.640
Is he under some kind of spell?!

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:36.410
<i>This way... Come...</i>

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:38.910
The gem is leading me...!

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.100
That must be it!

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:43.690
Get a hold of yourself, Lief.

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:46.190
I'm fine, Barda.

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:47.630
The gem is waiting for me.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.970
Shit, I can't see a thing!

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:57.100
Oh right, the Light-Bubble Pipe!

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:00.300
You had that with you too?!

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:03.610
This isn't the time to ask questions, is it?

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.290
Something is there!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:21.550
Are you the one who called me...?

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:26.190
<i>That's right, it was me, Lief of Del.</i>

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:27.920
Stop, Lief!

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:29.410
Don't go any further!

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:30.500
It's dangerous!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.400
I can't stop.

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:35.140
The belt is telling me to go on.

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:37.680
<i>That's right, come to me...</i>

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:41.720
<i>I've been waiting for you for so long...</i>

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.200
What are you...?

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.800
<i>I am the guardian of this place, Reeah,</i>

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:51.420
<i>Lief of Del.</i>

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:53.300
<i>Now, come this way...</i>

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.500
Where's the gem?

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.100
<i>Gem?</i>

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.800
<i>Is this what you're looking for?</i>

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.620
It's the opal...

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.950
I finally found it...

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:10.610
<i>Now, take off the belt...</i>

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:11.540
The belt?

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:14.580
<i>That's right, remove it now...</i>

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.500
Alright...

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:20.810
What are you doing, Lief!?

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:22.000
Let me go...

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:22.800
Lief!

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:25.240
Get a hold of yourself!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.100
Let me go..!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.600
What's gotten into you?

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:35.870
Trying to take off the belt all of a sudden...

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:37.390
Huh? The belt?

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:40.400
You touched the topaz, did you?

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.900
Then...!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.230
H-He... he's...!

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.220
I am known as Reeah.

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:07.400
And I'm going to take that belt from you, Lief!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:10.700
Let's see you try!

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:22.590
Why he isn't attacking, I wonder...

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:24.800
It's the ruby's power.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.600
It's written in the Book of Deltora!

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:31.340
<i>"The great ruby, symbol of happiness, red as blood."</i>

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:35.200
<i>"Grows pale in the presence of evil..."</i>

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.660
"The ruby has the power to ward off evil..."

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.190
So he must have felt the ruby's power!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.980
Lief of Del...

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:46.600
Certainly, you are protected by some kind of magic.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:50.510
However, it's still not powerful enough to save you!

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.000
I can't move...!

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:56.500
Barda... Jasmine...

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.200
I'll try to divert its attention...

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:01.850
So use that chance to grab the opal from it!

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:03.200
What do you intend to do?!

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:06.220
I don't know, but I have to do something!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:09.440
Lief!
Lief!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.800
I have ruby's power on my side!

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:17.500
Even if you're much stronger than me, I will not go down easily!

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:22.600
I commend you for your bravery. However...

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:25.010
That won't be enough to defeat me, Lief!

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:28.800
How have you known my name from the beginning?

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:32.780
The gem which allows me to see into the future is in my possession.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:37.800
I am the all-powerful Reeah, the
Shadow Lord's most trusted servant!

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:42.720
Were you the one who drove people away from this place?

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:43.990
That's right!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:50.400
Those foolish humans were easily driven away by my precious rats and they surrendered this land to me.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.310
Why would you do that?!

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:55.960
It was to protect the opal.

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:59.670
Protecting this stone is my life's duty.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:04.760
And for that purpose, I spread a plague so that humans would stay away from this place.

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:06.630
What's with this guy...

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:09.880
Why did you have to go to such lengths to protect the opal?!

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:15.300
It is all according to the desires of my one and only master, the Shadow Lord.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:19.290
The very world itself moves according to my master's will.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:21.200
There's no way I'd let that happen!

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.220
Don't underestimate us humans!

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:25.410
How impertinent.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:28.870
Just what can a powerless human like yourself do anyway?

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:31.660
I have the power of faith!

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:33.910
I will make Deltora a better kingdom!

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:38.600
And to achieve that, I will defeat you and take back the opal!

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:01.220
This is unforgivable, you damn brat!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:04.770
Watch out!

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:09.630
Its head... has turned to three?!

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:15.500
I told you, did I not?

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:19.570
Your magic is reasonably strong, but it won't be enough to defeat me!

00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:22.390
Prepare yourself, Lief of Del!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:30.780
Lief!!

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:31.710
Are you alright?!

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:33.140
Barda!

00:17:33.350 --> 00:17:34.300
Lief!

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.920
I will swallow you and that belt in one gulp!

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:02.090
The belt! The belt!!

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:06.900
I won't let you!

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:51.700
Lief!

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:53.170
Lief!

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:56.980
Lief, please, open your eyes!

00:18:58.600 --> 00:18:59.500
That's right...

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.640
Let's use the nectar from the Lillies of Life!

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:04.870
You mean the stuff that saved me before?

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:08.450
Yes. We can probably save him if we make him drink this nectar!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:24.400
Lief...

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:25.840
Lief...!

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:27.700
You've come back around, huh?

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.300
I...

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:34.200
I see...

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:36.470
You used the Lily of Life's nectar...

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:40.800
We only have enough nectar for one more portion, though.

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:42.120
Thank you.

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:50.140
But, even if I'm being too reckless, I will still fight for everyone's freedom, I think.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:52.800
I wasn't able to say it properly last night,

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:57.500
But I'm doing this so that the people of Del, Manus, Tira,

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.310
Can escape from the Shadow Lord's rule.

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:04.730
Me too. I became too reckless before I knew it...

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:08.700
Trying to cut open its throat with just this dagger...

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:13.270
We aren't fighting for the king's sake.

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:16.120
We're fighting for our freedom.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:18.210
And you're the one who taught me that.

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:19.600
Jasmine...

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:25.770
So from now on, I'm going to keep fighting for freedom, because that's what I've decided.

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:29.040
Just like Tira who saved us back then.

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:32.910
So let's save them in return someday.

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:34.000
Yeah.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:36.550
Yeah.

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:41.000
Oh right, what happened to Reeah's crown and the opal?

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:44.290
About that...

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:46.740
We were focused on escaping, so the crown...

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:48.700
No way...

00:20:56.470 --> 00:20:57.340
Jasmine.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.400
We couldn't retrieve the crown...

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:04.030
But the opal is right here.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:05.900
Barda...!

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:07.890
Don't scare me like that!

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:09.760
Here.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:10.480
Thanks.

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:27.600
Barda!

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:28.900
Jasmine!

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:39.470
It's a shame, but it seems like the future the opal shows...

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:43.100
Isn't always filled with happiness and laughter.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:49.680
But don't forget, the opal is also said to be the gem of hope.

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:57.210
I guess you're right, Barda.

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:04.840
Lief acquired the third gem, the opal.

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:11.950
I don't know what the journey to the fourth gem will entail,

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:15.630
But I'm sure it will be much worse
compared to the three we've gathered.

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:16.770
I just know it.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:21.100
So you'll join us on our journey from now on, right?

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:25.200
It's unavoidable, isn't it? It's a journey to take back our freedom after all.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:41.250
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:46.920
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.880
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.650
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:05.950
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.550
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.330
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:24.300
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:32.540
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:38.480
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:44.490
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:50.800
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:59.010
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.650 --> 00:24:08.000
The giant snake, Reeah.

00:24:09.020 --> 00:24:11.530
The Shadow Lord's number one servant,

00:24:11.530 --> 00:24:15.380
It is a giant snake that protects the opal in the City of the Rats.

00:24:15.380 --> 00:24:19.200
It's able to shed its skin and turn into a more ferocious monster.

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:25.030
"I have something that I need to tell you," I said before telling them a story.

00:24:25.030 --> 00:24:27.700
What really happened to the royalty of Deltora?

00:24:27.700 --> 00:24:30.610
And what about the friendship between my father and the king?

00:24:30.610 --> 00:24:32.310
ENDON AND JARRED

00:24:32.310 --> 00:24:34.570
Next time, 'Endon and Jarred'.
